<title>USA: Lilly Industries names John Elbin CFO.</title>
<headline>Lilly Industries names John Elbin CFO.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lilly Industries Inc said it named John Elbin chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Elbin was formerly chief financial officer at Pet Inc, said Lilly, an industrial coatings and chemicals firm.</p>
<p>Pet Inc is a unit of Grand Metropolitan Plc.</p>
<p>Elbin replaces Roman Klusas, who resigned in September, Lilly said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
